              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "DrGaellon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "The marinade is delicious, but stew beef needs long slow cooking to make it tender. I used a thick ribeye steak, which I cut into 1 1/2\" cubes at home before marinating."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
