            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Patricia Barber"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved this recipe. I used cube steak and it worked great. I made my own Greek Seasoning since that wasn’t easy to find in the store but I had all the ingredients in my spice cabinet.",
            "datePublished": "2020-04-09T17:56:07.017Z"
