              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "snowday"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a good recipe as is. I felt it was better with a couple of changes. 1) It is tough, and either needs a more tender cut of meat, or a few hours in the slow cooker. 2) I wanted to accentuate the sweetness a little, so instead of dark corn syrup I used half light corn syrup and half molasses. It was just right for my family.",
